Subject: [PATCH 2/2] ak820pro (dev): codex's handler review -- only a command
 that reached a setter with arguments it applies renews the lease (a short
 report or SET_LINE past line 1 does not); the lease and its stamp dev-only;
 the lease applies after exactly 10 s, not at; and R4-3: raw HID's media drops
 a lock-LED frame being assembled

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Mm219BiSCsx6uwtXcZ7a9G
---
 .../a_jazz/ak820pro/bluetooth/ch582f_ajazz.c  |  7 ++++
 .../a_jazz/ak820pro/bluetooth/ch582f_ajazz.h  |  2 +
 keyboards/a_jazz/ak820pro/hid_protocol.c      | 41 ++++++++++++-------
 3 files changed, 36 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)

diff --git a/keyboards/a_jazz/ak820pro/bluetooth/ch582f_ajazz.c b/keyboards/a_jazz/ak820pro/bluetooth/ch582f_ajazz.c
index feea304f..42675bcd 100644
--- a/keyboards/a_jazz/ak820pro/bluetooth/ch582f_ajazz.c
+++ b/keyboards/a_jazz/ak820pro/bluetooth/ch582f_ajazz.c
@@ -448,6 +448,13 @@ static void lockchan_media_commit(const lockchan_frame_t *f) {
     lcm_applied++;
 }
 
+/* Raw HID just changed the display (hid_protocol.c): drop any lock-LED frame
+ * being assembled, so none can straddle it and commit after (R4-3). The LED
+ * baseline goes too; the next report only sets it. */
+void ch582_lockchan_rawhid(void) {
+    lockchan_link_lost(&lockchan);
+}
+
 void ch582_lockchan_media_counts(uint32_t out[3]) {
     out[0] = lcm_applied;
     out[1] = lcm_rejected;
diff --git a/keyboards/a_jazz/ak820pro/bluetooth/ch582f_ajazz.h b/keyboards/a_jazz/ak820pro/bluetooth/ch582f_ajazz.h
